{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41201","headline":"哭赵州和尚二首 一 · 王熔","name":"哭赵州和尚二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"师离㴲水动王侯，心印光潜麈尾收。\n碧落雾霾松岭月，沧溟浪覆济人舟。\n一灯乍灭波旬喜，双眼重昏道侣愁。\n纵是了然云外客，每瞻缾几泪还流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王熔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}